    description: "From the WI-kosup reader census (2026-10-28; /home/jgstern_agent/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/kosup_reader_census_10282026/A_fields.md, axis section). Fields declared '# axis: free-text -- ... never branched on / not parsed' that DO have a branch reader (ADR-0058's distinction; WI-fuzat was the previous instance):\n- UsageContext.position: cli.py ~:9452 branches on the value \"view_func\"; framework_patterns.py ~:168 regex-matches it.\n- IoChain.primitive: matched against HIGH_RISK_PRIMITIVES.\n- UsageContext.context_name: regex-matched.\n- Symbol.name compared to \"main\", \"Java_*\" and similar; Symbol.path goes through is_test_file.\n(8 fields in all; the report lists each with file:line.) Fix: re-declare each as what it is (identity / bounded-enum with its values / free-text with a TRUE justification), or move the branch onto a declared field. A free-text justification must be present, not true (0051, 0058) -- this item is about the ones whose justification is FALSE."  # a194
